From: Fostrom <noreply@fostrom.io>
Subject: [PATCH] fwup: bump to v1.17.0

1.16.0 computes the delta source size as an int times the block size, which
overflows at exactly 2 GiB, the size of an amd64 rootfs slot, so whether a
delta applies depends on how the compiler treated the overflow. 1.17.0 widens
it and raises the default block cache to 32 MB.

nerves_system_br's own 0011 patch took the package to 1.16.0; this applies
after it.

---
 package/fwup/fwup.hash | 2 +-
 package/fwup/fwup.mk   | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/fwup/fwup.hash b/package/fwup/fwup.hash
--- a/package/fwup/fwup.hash
+++ b/package/fwup/fwup.hash
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 # Locally calculated
-sha256  0634925dc1a0a0dcd81f6b67a93247684df556a1aa3c71ef3e9d51c4393b8933  fwup-1.16.0.tar.gz
+sha256  513ec1546728371d7fd972e44375cd81f6ce0d308e0833552c78da309035b749  fwup-1.17.0.tar.gz
 sha256  cfc7749b96f63bd31c3c42b5c471bf756814053e847c10f3eb003417bc523d30  LICENSE
diff --git a/package/fwup/fwup.mk b/package/fwup/fwup.mk
--- a/package/fwup/fwup.mk
+++ b/package/fwup/fwup.mk
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 #
 ################################################################################

-FWUP_VERSION = 1.16.0
+FWUP_VERSION = 1.17.0
 FWUP_SITE = $(call github,fwup-home,fwup,v$(FWUP_VERSION))
 FWUP_LICENSE = Apache-2.0
 FWUP_LICENSE_FILES = LICENSE
